"Registration OTP" > "Passenger account": role passenger plus email, then consume OTP
"Registration OTP" > "Driver account": role driver plus email, then consume OTP
"Admin publishes immutable fare revision" > "Ride request: fare policy reference + rate snapshot": ObjectId reference plus copied calculation inputs
"Passenger account" > "Ride request: fare policy reference + rate snapshot": passenger ObjectId
"Ride request: fare policy reference + rate snapshot" > "Driver pool: seat assignment + vehicle snapshot": pool ObjectId and embedded membership
"Driver account" > "Driver pool: seat assignment + vehicle snapshot": driver ObjectId
"Ride request: fare policy reference + rate snapshot" > "Passenger ride history": owner-only query
"Driver pool: seat assignment + vehicle snapshot" > "Driver trip history": owner-only query

